{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "ויפץ", :translit "vayafetz", :gloss "and he/it scattered"} {:he "ויפץ העם בכל ארץ מצרים", :translit "vayafetz ha-am be-chol eretz mitzrayim", :gloss "and the people were scattered throughout the land of Egypt"} {:he "ויפץ העם מעליו", :translit "vayafetz ha-am me-alav", :gloss "and the people scattered from around him"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["ויפץ" "ויפץ העם בכל ארץ מצרים" "ויפץ העם מעליו"]}], :frame {:text "The Ba'al HaTurim cites a midrashic reading that links the scattering at the Tower of Babel (Genesis 11:8) with the scattering of the Egyptian people during the plague of hail (Exodus 9:20, where those who feared God brought livestock indoors) and the scattering of the people from around Saul (I Samuel 14:20). The shared rare root ויפץ signals that the generation of the Tower and the Egyptians were equally fit for the same punishment of dispersion.", :sources ["Genesis 11:8" "Exodus 9:20" "I Samuel 14:20"]}} {:quotes [{:he "ויחדלו", :translit "vayachdelu", :gloss "and they/it ceased"} {:he "ויחדלו הקולות והברד", :translit "vayachdelu ha-kolot u-varad", :gloss "and the sounds and the hail ceased"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["ויחדלו" "ויחדלו הקולות והברד"]}], :frame {:text "The rare word ויחדלו appears only twice: at the cessation of building the Tower (Genesis 11:8) and at the cessation of the plague of hail in Egypt (Exodus 9:33). The Ba'al HaTurim infers from this verbal link that just as the hail plague was punished through sounds and hail, so too the generation of the Tower was judged by the same means.", :sources ["Genesis 11:8" "Exodus 9:33"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["ויפץ" "ויפץ העם בכל ארץ מצרים" "ויפץ העם מעליו"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "ויפץ", :refs ["Genesis 11:8" "Exodus 5:12" "1 Samuel 13:8"], :n 3, :lens :exact} {:phrase "ויפץ העם בכל ארץ מצרים", :refs ["Exodus 5:12"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phra